{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfhNfkQDpw1MGMYFGNK9B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The race is fixed: only the most recent `search()` call can now update results, loading, or errors, and clearing the query invalidates anything still in flight.\n\n**Cause:** every request in `src/search/controller.ts` wrote its outcome to state unconditionally when it settled, so a slow earlier request could overwrite newer results, show its error, or turn off the loading indicator.\n\n**Fix:** the controller keeps a `latestRequest` counter (9 lines changed, that file only). Each `search()` call takes the next number, and its results, error, and loading-off updates are applied only if it is still the latest. Clearing the query also takes a number, so a request that finishes afterwards cannot repopulate results. The public API, the API adapter, the view and the tests are untouched.\n\n**Verification:**\n- The existing suite (`npm test`) passes, 4 of 4.\n- A temporary race check, run from outside the repo and then deleted, passed both scenarios:\n  - A stale success and a stale failure are ignored while a newer request is still loading.\n  - A request resolving after the query was cleared leaves the state empty.\n\nStale requests are ignored rather than aborted, since `SearchApi.search` takes no abort signal and adding one would change the API. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1613,"cache_read_input_tokens":10153,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1613},"output_tokens":408,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50e8071d-9570-4e4d-a965-7f4209d689f0","uuid":"31243100-43b5-47c8-b060-53d91e7628d7","timestamp":"2026-10-04T14:43:24.928Z","request_id":"req_011CfhNfjcr6V74ceaEaqtmq"}
